  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Safeguarding, Refurbishment and Revitalization of the Islamic Museum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to create the necessary conditions to conserve and safeguard the collections of the Islamic Museum through: refurbishment and equipping of its interior; building the professional capacity of museum professionals in various domains (conservation, exhibition development, public and educational programme development, museum management and administration, etc) through targeted training; and developing a basic electronic inventory of the entire collection, including photographic documentation and object condition reports. Thanks to this the Museum will be officially reopened with suitable visitor services.</narrative>
  </description>
